  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nNEW FINS HAVE LANDED 🏄 SHOP NOW \n\nSHOP\nEXPLORE\nCart\nImage 2 is now available in gallery view\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 2 in modal\n\nRIDE\n\nFCS II PERFORMER NEO GLASS TRI FINS\nRegular price\n$85.00 USD\nSize\nX-SMALL\n SMALL\n MEDIUM\nQuantity\nDecrease quantity for FCS II PERFORMER NEO GLASS TRI FINS\nIncrease quantity for FCS II PERFORMER NEO GLASS TRI FINS\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Softech.\n\nDesigned for a balance of speed, flow & response. Ideal for surfers who want a reliable all 'round fin delivering a combination of speed and maneuverability with flow between turns.\n\n\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\nCollapsible content\nDETAILS\n\nOVERVIEW\n\nDesigned for a balance of speed, flow & response with added control. Oversized, all-round template with a fuller tip. Ideal for surfers who like to attack the wave and perform aggressive turns.\n\n\nIDEAL CONDITIONS\n\nA wide range of conditions, particularly good in critical overhead waves.\n\n\nBOARD TYPES\n\nDesigned to fit the FCS II Fin System. Recommended for performance softboards with moderate-to-low rocker.\n\nFIN SYSTEM\nSIZING\nSHIPPING\nRIDE WITH US\n\nBe the first to know about new collections and exclusive offers.\n\nEmail\nABOUT RIDE\nSTORIES\nRIDE TEAM\nCONTACT\n\nWe find freedom in the waves, and our journey to find those waves is half the fun.\n\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-ride-demo Powered by Shopify"
